  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hey VRChat Team,\n\nWith the Open Beta now live, we can finally set Emoji and Sticker permissions when launching an instance—awesome feature! But there’s a bit of a problem.\n\nIn cases like the \"Yokosuka Museum of Art -横須賀美術館-\", unauthorized stickers or emojis could cause legal or artistic issues. This might force world creators to make their worlds private or even take them down entirely, which would be a huge shame.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_1247aa9a-a86a-42ff-b1a4-7a8055424a50/info\n\nSo, how about letting Udon control Emoji and Sticker permissions, just like it can restrict avatar scaling? This would give creators more flexibility and help prevent unintended issues.\n\nWould love to hear your thoughts on this!\n\nThanks.",
